    "final": "The lowest price anyone charges for size M of the Wexcombe tee, among those that can actually be bought, is $13.02, at Carnforth Textile Company (Wexcombe Midweight Jersey Knit Tee, http://localhost:7770/igr-tcl-24.html). I opened all 45 tee listings from the search results (36 on page 1, 9 on page 2; every result was a Wexcombe tee, none were non-tee items). Of those, size M was selectable/buyable on 22 listings; size M was disabled (not purchasable) on 23 listings including the cheaper-advertised ones such as Dovercourt Apparel ($10.13), Whitlock Outfitters ($11.09), and Oakfield Textile Company ($11.69). The next-lowest buyable M prices were $14.48 (Dalston Textiles Official Store) and $16.30 (Dunmore Outfitters). Carnforth's $13.02 was confirmed by selecting M via the product page UI, which updated the price to $13.02 with Add to Cart enabled.",
